        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Leah Kunkel, Marty Gwinn Townsend, Renee Armand, Cass Elliot\n- Groups: Coyote Sisters, the Mamas & the Papas\n- Topics: family relationships, music careers\n\nFacts:\n- Cass Elliot, born Ellen Naomi Cohen, was born on September 19, 1941 and died on July 29, 1974.\n- Cass Elliot, also known as Mama Cass, was an American singer and actress.\n- Cass Elliot was best known as a member of the Mamas & the Papas.\n- Coyote Sisters is an American pop-rock female trio that was formed in 1980.\n- The members of Coyote Sisters are Leah Kunkel, Marty Gwinn Townsend, and Renee Armand.\n- Leah Kunkel is the younger sister of Cass Elliot.",
